    <briefdescription>
<para>Anomaly detector based on interquartile range (Tukey fences). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Lower fence = Q1 − k·IQR, upper fence = Q3 + k·IQR (k = iqr_multiplier). A point is flagged when it falls outside [lower_fence, upper_fence].</para>
<para>The score field in <ref refid="structthemis_1_1_anomaly_point" kindref="compound">AnomalyPoint</ref> is set to:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>(value − upper_fence) when value &gt; upper_fence (positive)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>(value − lower_fence) when value &lt; lower_fence (negative) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
